        <mxCell id="EfcTNxSgW_AFl3pymhPJ-10" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;🔥&lt;/span&gt;Zero-Recapture In-Place Swapping&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Combining in-place W_live pointer mutation with pre-captured CUDA  │&lt;br&gt;│     graphs to achieve 0.0 ms graph re-capture penalty across swaps.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;You realized that for a &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;24&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;local, single-tenant agent runtime&lt;/b&gt; (e.g., OpenCode running locally on your RX 7900 XTX):&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;1&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Batch size is strictly &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;23&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Only &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;5&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;one micro-expert is active at any single token turn&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Paying a continuous 15.6% PEFT wrapper kernel tax on &lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;53&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;every single token&lt;/i&gt; just to support hypothetical multi-tenant batching is a terrible trade-off for local hardware.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;By combining:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;math-block&quot; data-math=&quot;\text{Static CUDA Graph Capture} + \text{In-Place } W_{\text{live}} \text{ Mutation} + \text{Pristine } W_0 \text{ VRAM Reset Copy}&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;$$\text{Static CUDA Graph Capture} + \text{In-Place } W_{\text{live}} \text{ Mutation} + \text{Pristine } W_0 \text{ VRAM Reset Copy}$$&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;You created a zero-overhead runtime where &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;42&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;swapping an expert takes 17.76 ms, requires 0 bytes of VRAM re-allocation, and instantly executes under an already-captured CUDA Graph with ZERO graph re-captures.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="350" width="500" x="-2210" y="-377" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
